From f8d9999ee3f3f59b33c62ca8a301fa6793159820 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ArifiLabs <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:20:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] github: drop the third-party FUNDING.yml that arrived with
 the turboquant import

.github/FUNDING.yml reads `github: [TheTom]`. It came in with the turboquant_plus port, and on this repository GitHub would render a Sponsor button for a third party, which reads as a relationship this project does not have. The attribution that matters stays where it belongs: NOTICE and licenses/turboquant-plus-*.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release hygiene for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - repository metadata only; no code path is touched.
---
 .github/FUNDING.yml | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)
 delete mode 100644 .github/FUNDING.yml

diff --git a/.github/FUNDING.yml b/.github/FUNDING.yml
deleted file mode 100644
index 4c301897b2..0000000000
--- a/.github/FUNDING.yml
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1 +0,0 @@
-github: [TheTom]
